{# DeD FHU inflation — disposition guidance for witnesses. ACTING-NPC-keyed:
   the branches read the ACTING NPC's arousal tier (get_ded_arousal), NOT the
   swollen actor's — a neutral witness and a fascinated witness react
   differently to the same inflated actor (the planner's
   fascination/disgust matrix as disposition text). Eligibility via
   get_ded_inflation_any (module-owned companion decorator, the 132b class):
   an in-band inflated actor in the observer's cell. Tier-0 = silence (the
   anti-obsession rule; 0171's tier-1 floor).

   REV-157 (2026-10-24) — the 0520 mold applied to FHU. Lane conventions
   transcribed exactly: this lane's actor variable is npc.UUID (the
   0050/0550 ufi precedent — decorators ARE used in this lane), NOT
   actor_uuid; NO render_mode gate (the 0520 hardening — no surveyed
   user_final_instructions fragment reads render_mode, and eligibility via
   get_ded_inflation_any already renders nothing when nothing is in band);
   the tier read is guarded (default() + isNumber; tier defaults 0 =
   silence when the arousal framework is absent — the s9 null contract).
   NULL CONTRACT (psc side, REV-157): get_ded_inflation_any always returns
   well-formed JSON — {"any": false} under every absent-framework state.
   Branch texts below are STRATEGIST DRAFT (register entry 36) — the
   user's ruling gates INSTALL; first enabled render IS the probe
   (clean = LIVE; error box = escalate). #}
{% set dedany = get_ded_inflation_any(npc.UUID) %}
{% if dedany and dedany.any %}
{% set tier = default(get_ded_arousal(npc.UUID).tier, 0) %}
{% if not isNumber(tier) %}
{% set tier = 0 %}
{% endif %}
{% if tier == 3 %}
When reacting to the swollen belly, run hot — open fascination and hungry appraisal; you do not bother hiding how the sight holds you.
{% else if tier == 2 %}
When reacting to the swollen belly, be intrigued — curiosity and appraising looks, a fascination you keep just short of a stare.
{% else if tier == 1 %}
When reacting to the swollen belly, be taken aback — shock, revulsion, or scandalized disapproval at the state of them.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
